    "['rsa local-key-pair create [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set system services ssh hostkey-algorithm ssh-rsa', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set system services ssh hostkey-algorithm ssh-rsa', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset system services ssh hostkey-algorithm ssh-rsa\\nset system services ssh hostkey-rsa key-size 2048\\n##\\n\\nAlternatively, if you specifically need the key generation command (equivalent to \"create\" in Huawei), you could also use:\\n##\\nrequest system security generate-key-pair rsa with-key-size 2048\\n##\\n\\nNote: The first approach configures SSH to use RSA keys with 2048-bit size, while the second approach actively generates the key pair. Juniper doesn\\'t have a direct 1:1 equivalent to Huawei\\'s combined \"rsa local-key-pair create\" command, so either approach would be valid depending on your specific needs.', 'trans_template': 'set system services ssh hostkey-algorithm ssh-rsa'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set system services ssh hostkey-rsa key-size 2048', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set system services ssh hostkey-rsa key-size 2048', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset system services ssh hostkey-algorithm ssh-rsa\\nset system services ssh hostkey-rsa key-size 2048\\n##\\n\\nAlternatively, if you specifically need the key generation command (equivalent to \"create\" in Huawei), you could also use:\\n##\\nrequest system security generate-key-pair rsa with-key-size 2048\\n##\\n\\nNote: The first approach configures SSH to use RSA keys with 2048-bit size, while the second approach actively generates the key pair. Juniper doesn\\'t have a direct 1:1 equivalent to Huawei\\'s combined \"rsa local-key-pair create\" command, so either approach would be valid depending on your specific needs.', 'trans_template': 'set system services ssh hostkey-rsa key-size 2048'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'request system security generate-key-pair rsa with-key-size 2048', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'request system security generate-key-pair rsa with-key-size 2048', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset system services ssh hostkey-algorithm ssh-rsa\\nset system services ssh hostkey-rsa key-size 2048\\n##\\n\\nAlternatively, if you specifically need the key generation command (equivalent to \"create\" in Huawei), you could also use:\\n##\\nrequest system security generate-key-pair rsa with-key-size 2048\\n##\\n\\nNote: The first approach configures SSH to use RSA keys with 2048-bit size, while the second approach actively generates the key pair. Juniper doesn\\'t have a direct 1:1 equivalent to Huawei\\'s combined \"rsa local-key-pair create\" command, so either approach would be valid depending on your specific needs.', 'trans_template': 'request system security generate-key-pair rsa with-key-size 2048'}]]": 1,
