    "['ssh server cipher [parameter1] [parameter2] [parameter3]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set system services ssh ciphers aes128-ctr', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set system services ssh ciphers aes128-ctr', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the equivalent Juniper configuration for the specified HUAWEI command:\\n\\n##\\nset system services ssh ciphers aes128-ctr\\nset system services ssh ciphers aes192-ctr\\nset system services ssh ciphers aes256-ctr\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Junos, you need to set each cipher algorithm separately rather than in a single command like Huawei's implementation. The commands configure SSH to use the same three encryption algorithms (AES in CTR mode with 128, 192, and 256-bit keys).\", 'trans_template': 'set system services ssh ciphers aes128-ctr'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set system services ssh ciphers aes192-ctr', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set system services ssh ciphers aes192-ctr', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the equivalent Juniper configuration for the specified HUAWEI command:\\n\\n##\\nset system services ssh ciphers aes128-ctr\\nset system services ssh ciphers aes192-ctr\\nset system services ssh ciphers aes256-ctr\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Junos, you need to set each cipher algorithm separately rather than in a single command like Huawei's implementation. The commands configure SSH to use the same three encryption algorithms (AES in CTR mode with 128, 192, and 256-bit keys).\", 'trans_template': 'set system services ssh ciphers aes192-ctr'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set system services ssh ciphers aes256-ctr', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set system services ssh ciphers aes256-ctr', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the equivalent Juniper configuration for the specified HUAWEI command:\\n\\n##\\nset system services ssh ciphers aes128-ctr\\nset system services ssh ciphers aes192-ctr\\nset system services ssh ciphers aes256-ctr\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Junos, you need to set each cipher algorithm separately rather than in a single command like Huawei's implementation. The commands configure SSH to use the same three encryption algorithms (AES in CTR mode with 128, 192, and 256-bit keys).\", 'trans_template': 'set system services ssh ciphers aes256-ctr'}]]": 1,
